sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Terminal as NFC Hardware
    participant API as Backend Controller
    participant DB as Database

    User->>Terminal: Tap NFC Tag
    Terminal->>API: HTTP POST Tag UID
    API->>DB: Query User & Settings
    DB-->>API: Return Record
    API->>DB: Insert / Update Attendance Log
    DB-->>API: Confirm Transaction
    API-->>Terminal: Return Status Response
    Terminal-->>User: Visual / Audio Feedback